<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Joined unto Christ the risen Lord,</l><l>Triumphant now above;</l><l>The glory of His cross reveals</l><l>Magnificence of love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Joined unto Christ’s full victory,</l><l>Magnificently free;</l><l>Declare it in the conquering name,</l><l>And powers of darkness flee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Joined unto Christ! Magnificent!</l><l>His wondrous Calvary plan,</l><l>Draws us through ages to adore;</l><l>For “Worthy is the Lamb.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
